[{"id":"akhlafa-30-6-3","words":["verb:akhlafa"],"options":[{"bs":"krši","en":"breaks"},{"bs":"prekršili smo obećanje","en":"we broke (a promise)"},{"bs":"nadoknađuje ga","en":"he/it replaces it"},{"bs":"prekršili su obećanje","en":"they broke (a promise)"}],"ref":"30:6","answerWord":"يُخْلِفُ","answerSound":"audio/f5cfb2d418095adf71c5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It is a promise of Allah. Allah faileth not His promise, but most of mankind know not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prekršiti (obećanje)","en":"to break (a promise)"},"passage":["وَعْدَ","ٱللَّهِ","لَا","يُخْلِفُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَعْدَهُۥ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","أَكْثَرَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","لَا","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْلَفَ"}},{"id":"akhlafa-2-80-13","words":["verb:akhlafa"],"options":[{"bs":"krši obećanje","en":"he/it breaks (a promise)"},{"bs":"prekršili su obećanje","en":"they broke (a promise)"},{"bs":"pa sam vam prekršio obećanje","en":"so I broke my promise to you (all)"},{"bs":"kršimo ga","en":"we break it"}],"ref":"2:80","answerWord":"يُخْلِفَ","answerSound":"audio/2fe5907210592c6935cd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they say: The Fire (of punishment) will not touch us save for a certain number of days. Say: Have ye received a covenant from Allah - truly Allah will not break His covenant - or tell ye concerning Allah that which ye know not?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prekršiti (obećanje)","en":"to break (a promise)"},"passage":["وَقَالُوا۟","لَن","تَمَسَّنَا","ٱلنَّارُ","إِلَّآ","أَيَّامًا","مَّعْدُودَةً","قُلْ","أَتَّخَذْتُمْ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","عَهْدًا","فَلَن","يُخْلِفَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَهْدَهُۥٓ","أَمْ","تَقُولُونَ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","مَا","لَا","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْلَفَ"}},{"id":"akhlafa-9-77-8","words":["verb:akhlafa"],"options":[{"bs":"prekršili su obećanje","en":"they broke (a promise)"},{"bs":"prekršili smo obećanje","en":"we broke (a promise)"},{"bs":"nadoknađuje ga","en":"he/it replaces it"},{"bs":"krši","en":"breaks"}],"ref":"9:77","answerWord":"أَخْلَفُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/53088d7a36eacb9f68bd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So He hath made the consequence (to be) hypocrisy in their hearts until the day when they shall meet Him, because they broke their word to Allah that they promised Him, and because they lied.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prekršiti (obećanje)","en":"to break (a promise)"},"passage":["فَأَعْقَبَهُمْ","نِفَاقًا","فِى","قُلُوبِهِمْ","إِلَىٰ","يَوْمِ","يَلْقَوْنَهُۥ","بِمَآ","أَخْلَفُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","مَا","وَعَدُوهُ","وَبِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَكْذِبُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْلَفَ"}},{"id":"akhlafa-20-58-8","words":["verb:akhlafa"],"options":[{"bs":"kršimo ga","en":"we break it"},{"bs":"prekršili su obećanje","en":"they broke (a promise)"},{"bs":"prekršili smo obećanje","en":"we broke (a promise)"},{"bs":"pa sam vam prekršio obećanje","en":"so I broke my promise to you (all)"}],"ref":"20:58","answerWord":"نُخْلِفُهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/430a33b8aa3c8516556e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But we surely can produce for thee magic the like thereof; so appoint a tryst between us and you, which neither we nor thou shall fail to keep, at a place convenient (to us both).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prekršiti (obećanje)","en":"to break (a promise)"},"passage":["فَلَنَأْتِيَنَّكَ","بِسِحْرٍ","مِّثْلِهِۦ","فَٱجْعَلْ","بَيْنَنَا","وَبَيْنَكَ","مَوْعِدًا","لَّا","نُخْلِفُهُۥ","نَحْنُ","وَلَآ","أَنتَ","مَكَانًا","سُوًى"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْلَفَ"}},{"id":"akhlafa-20-87-2","words":["verb:akhlafa"],"options":[{"bs":"prekršili smo obećanje","en":"we broke (a promise)"},{"bs":"nadoknađuje ga","en":"he/it replaces it"},{"bs":"pa sam vam prekršio obećanje","en":"so I broke my promise to you (all)"},{"bs":"prekršili su obećanje","en":"they broke (a promise)"}],"ref":"20:87","answerWord":"أَخْلَفْنَا","answerSound":"audio/ef93cd030fd454138c24.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: We broke not tryst with thee of our own will, but we were laden with burdens of ornaments of the folk, then cast them (in the fire), for thus As-Samiri proposed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prekršiti (obećanje)","en":"to break (a promise)"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","مَآ","أَخْلَفْنَا","مَوْعِدَكَ","بِمَلْكِنَا","وَلَٰكِنَّا","حُمِّلْنَآ","أَوْزَارًا","مِّن","زِينَةِ","ٱلْقَوْمِ","فَقَذَفْنَٰهَا","فَكَذَٰلِكَ","أَلْقَى","ٱلسَّامِرِىُّ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْلَفَ"}},{"id":"akhlafa-34-39-16","words":["verb:akhlafa"],"options":[{"bs":"nadoknađuje ga","en":"he/it replaces it"},{"bs":"prekršili su obećanje","en":"they broke (a promise)"},{"bs":"prekršili smo obećanje","en":"we broke (a promise)"},{"bs":"pa sam vam prekršio obećanje","en":"so I broke my promise to you (all)"}],"ref":"34:39","answerWord":"يُخْلِفُهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/002bb4c8fde252fcbd5f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Lo! my Lord enlargeth the provision for whom He will of His bondmen, and narroweth (it) for him. And whatsoever ye spend (for good) He replaceth it. And He is the Best of Providers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prekršiti (obećanje)","en":"to break (a promise)"},"passage":["قُلْ","إِنَّ","رَبِّى","يَبْسُطُ","ٱلرِّزْقَ","لِمَن","يَشَآءُ","مِنْ","عِبَادِهِۦ","وَيَقْدِرُ","لَهُۥ","وَمَآ","أَنفَقْتُم","مِّن","شَىْءٍ","فَهُوَ","يُخْلِفُهُۥ","وَهُوَ","خَيْرُ","ٱلرَّٰزِقِينَ"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"أَخْلَفَ"}},{"id":"talaqqa-2-37-0","words":["verb:talaqqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa je primio","en":"then received"},{"bs":"primaju","en":"receive"},{"bs":"i dočekat će ih","en":"and will meet them"},{"bs":"prenosite je","en":"you (all) pass it on"}],"ref":"2:37","answerWord":"فَتَلَقَّىٰٓ","answerSound":"audio/8b6b594316c4678bb51b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then Adam received from his Lord words (of revelation), and He relented toward him. Lo! He is the relenting, the Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"primiti","en":"to receive"},"passage":["فَتَلَقَّىٰٓ","ءَادَمُ","مِن","رَّبِّهِۦ","كَلِمَٰتٍ","فَتَابَ","عَلَيْهِ","إِنَّهُۥ","هُوَ","ٱلتَّوَّابُ","ٱلرَّحِيمُ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"تَلَقَّى"}},{"id":"talaqqa-24-15-1","words":["verb:talaqqa"],"options":[{"bs":"prenosite je","en":"you (all) pass it on"},{"bs":"pa je primio","en":"then received"},{"bs":"primaju","en":"receive"},{"bs":"i dočekat će ih","en":"and will meet them"}],"ref":"24:15","answerWord":"تَلَقَّوْنَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/0c42965cc2bb94c5458d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When ye welcomed it with your tongues, and uttered with your mouths that whereof ye had no knowledge, ye counted it a trifle. In the sight of Allah it is very great.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"primiti","en":"to receive"},"passage":["إِذْ","تَلَقَّوْنَهُۥ","بِأَلْسِنَتِكُمْ","وَتَقُولُونَ","بِأَفْوَاهِكُم","مَّا","لَيْسَ","لَكُم","بِهِۦ","عِلْمٌ","وَتَحْسَبُونَهُۥ","هَيِّنًا","وَهُوَ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","عَظِيمٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"تَلَقَّى"}},{"id":"talaqqa-50-17-1","words":["verb:talaqqa"],"options":[{"bs":"primaju","en":"receive"},{"bs":"pa je primio","en":"then received"},{"bs":"i dočekat će ih","en":"and will meet them"},{"bs":"prenosite je","en":"you (all) pass it on"}],"ref":"50:17","answerWord":"يَتَلَقَّى","answerSound":"audio/e7ab1a5857ac86f93f78.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When the two Receivers receive (him), seated on the right hand and on the left,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"primiti","en":"to receive"},"passage":["إِذْ","يَتَلَقَّى","ٱلْمُتَلَقِّيَانِ","عَنِ","ٱلْيَمِينِ","وَعَنِ","ٱلشِّمَالِ","قَعِيدٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"تَلَقَّى"}}]